{
  "name": "dsh-pet-kunyu",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "dsh-pet 的坤宇（KunYuEcosystem）后端适配层：零修改加载原装 dsh-pet 插件，为它注入 webServer / llm / agentDefaultModel / credentials / commands 五个宿主服务，并提供 kunyu Agent 事件 → session/event 的工作状态桥。物理、拖拽、多宠物、配置合并、碎碎念与对话全部沿用原作实现。",
  "type": "module",
  "license": "MIT",
  "main": "lib/pet-host.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/pet-host.js",
    "./agent-event-bridge": "./lib/agent-event-bridge.js"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "peerDependencies": {
    "dsh-pet": ">=0.3.0"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.12.0"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/PC2005-cloud/dsh-pet.git"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-pet",
    "kunyu",
    "backend",
    "desktop-pet"
  ]
}
